   "id": "test-design",
   "title": "Test Design Techniques",
   "subtitle": "Choose the few tests that matter",
   "description": "You cannot test everything. Learn black-box techniques — equivalence partitioning, boundary value analysis, decision tables, state transitions, use-case and exploratory testing — with fully worked examples.",
