   "id": "cli-git",
   "title": "Command Line & Git",
   "subtitle": "Work where the code lives",
   "description": "Terminal survival, files/permissions/processes/logs, Git fundamentals, branches and pull requests, and reading a repo as a tester. Assumes zero prior command-line experience.",
   "color": "#ff8a3d",
   "phase": "p2",
